WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.500
Every field has a story. But are we reading the signs?

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:09.800
TERRA brings NASA Earth observations and field data together to reveal how farmland changes over time.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.470
Its Living Field Model connects environmental patterns, field history, and emerging risks.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:21.520
Then, explore crop rotations and compare how they may perform under changing climate conditions.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.120
Turning environmental intelligence into more informed agricultural decisions.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.900
TERRA. A smarter way to understand the land.
